erybody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.540" end="01:06.520">Well ma name is Ciara</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.520" end="01:08.570">For all you fly fellas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.570" end="01:10.610">No one can do it better</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.610" end="01:12.530">She'll sing on acapella</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.530" end="01:14.920">Boy the music</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.920" end="01:17.230">Makes me lose control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.230" end="01:18.730">We gone make you lose control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.510" end="01:20.010">And let it go fo you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.740" end="01:21.240">You gon hit tha flo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.880" end="01:22.380">I rock to the beat till I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.300" end="01:23.800" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Tired)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.380" end="01:24.880">Walk in da club it's</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.480" end="01:25.980" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Fiya)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.350" end="01:26.850">Get it crunked and wired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.540" end="01:28.290">Wave ya hands scream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.290" end="01:29.790" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Louda)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.940" end="01:30.440">If you smoke den fiya it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.310" end="01:31.990">Bring da roof down den</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.990" end="01:33.490" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Holla)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.950" end="01:34.450">If you tipsy stand up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.220" end="01:35.720">DJ turn it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.520" end="01:37.020" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Louda)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.540" end="01:38.080">Take somebody by da waist den</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.080" end="01:40.040"